</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Amended by Ordinance 178172, effective March 5, 2004.)&nbsp;</p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Awnings and signs attached to or incorporated into awnings must comply with all applicable standards of Chapters 32.30 through 32.38.3</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-d079d6d6a41ed95214f1af54f68283929b165cf4e95ca54c5e5972b15db3525f">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
