<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/32/52/050" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">32.52.050 Electrical Requirements.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li><strong>A.</strong>&nbsp;Electrical components of awnings must comply with the requirements of the Electrical Code.</li><li><strong>B.</strong> Horizontal and vertical clearances between power conductors and any awning must be as required in the Electrical Code.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
