    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Awnings must be maintained according to Section 32.42.030, Maintenance.&nbsp; The Director may determine an awning is dangerous according to Subsection 32.42.030 B, Dangerous structures and equipment.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
